              " ", "final"}], "-", 
             RowBox[{"production", " ", "seed", " ", 
              RowBox[{"range", "."}]}]}], "*)"}], 
           RowBox[{"p", "=", 
            RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"benchmarks", "[", "caseName", "]"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"<|", 
               RowBox[{"\"\<Seed\>\"", "->", "firstSeed"}], "|>"}]}], "]"}]}],
            ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
           RowBox[{"caseFolder", "=", 
            RowBox[{"CreateDirectory", "[", 
             RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{"folder", ",", "caseName"}], "}"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], 
           ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
           RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<[\>\"", ",", "j", ",", "\"\</\>\"", ",", 
             RowBox[{"Length", "[", "caseNames", "]"}], ",", 
             "\"\<] Starting \>\"", ",", "caseName", ",", "\"\< | \>\"", ",", 
             
             RowBox[{"batchSize", " ", "batchCount"}], ",", 
             "\"\< trials\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"seconds", ",", "raw"}], "}"}], "=", 
            RowBox[{"AbsoluteTiming", "[", 
             RowBox[{"TSScan", "[", 
              RowBox[{"p", ",", 
               RowBox[{"batchSize", " ", "batchCount"}], ",", 
               RowBox[{"\"\<Parallel\>\"", "->", "True"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], 
           ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
           RowBox[{"(*", 
            RowBox[{
            "All", " ", "records", " ", "are", " ", "saved", " ", "without", 
             " ", 
             RowBox[{"filtering", ".", "ApplyRowCut"}], " ", "is", " ", 
             "metadata", " ", "for", " ", "plotting", " ", "and", " ", 
             RowBox[{"analysis", "."}]}], "*)"}], 
           RowBox[{"dataFile", "=", 
            RowBox[{"Export", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", 
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{"caseFolder", ",", "\"\<data.wxf\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}],
               ",", 
              RowBox[{"<|", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"\"\<Parameters\>\"", "->", "p"}], ",", 
                RowBox[{"\"\<BatchSize\>\"", "->", "batchSize"}], ",", 
                RowBox[{"\"\<BatchCount\>\"", "->", "batchCount"}], ",", 
                RowBox[{"\"\<ApplyRowCut\>\"", "->", "applyRowCut"}], ",", 
                RowBox[{"\"\<Seconds\>\"", "->", "seconds"}], ",", 
                RowBox[{"\"\<RawResults\>\"", "->", "raw"}]}], "|>"}], ",", 
              "\"\<WXF\>\""}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
           RowBox[{"If", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"dataFile", "===", "$Failed"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
               RowBox[{
               "\"\<Data saving failed. Stopping at \>\"", ",", "caseName"}], 
               "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
              RowBox[{"Return", "[", 
               RowBox[{"<|", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"\"\<Folder\>\"", "->", "folder"}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"\"\<CompletedCases\>\"", "->", "summary"}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"\"\<UnsavedParameters\>\"", "->", "p"}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"\"\<UnsavedRawResults\>\"", "->", "raw"}]}], "|>"}],
                "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
           RowBox[{"scanOK", "=", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"ListQ", "[", "raw", "]"}], "&&", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"Length", "[", "raw", "]"}], "==", 
              RowBox[{"batchSize", " ", "batchCount"}]}]}]}], ";", 
           "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
           RowBox[{"row", "=", 
            RowBox[{"<|", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"\"\<Case\>\"", "->", "caseName"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"\"\<Parameters\>\"", "->", "p"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"\"\<Seconds\>\"", "->", "seconds"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"\"\<RecordCount\>\"", "->", 
               RowBox[{"If", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"ListQ", "[", "raw", "]"}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"Length", "[", "raw", "]"}], ",", "0"}], "]"}]}], 
              ",", 
              RowBox[{"\"\<Status\>\"", "->", 
               RowBox[{"If", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                "scanOK", ",", "\"\<Data saved\>\"", ",", 
                 "\"\<Incomplete scan saved\>\""}], "]"}]}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"\"\<CaseFolder\>\"", "->", "caseFolder"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"\"\<DataFile\>\"", "->", "dataFile"}]}], "|>"}]}], ";",
            "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
           RowBox[{"AppendTo", "[", 
            RowBox[{"summary", ",", "row"}], "]"}], ";", 
           "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
           RowBox[{"summaryFile", "=", 
            RowBox[{"Export", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", 
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{"folder", ",", "\"\<summary.wxf\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}], 
              ",", 
              RowBox[{"<|", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"\"\<Folder\>\"", "->", "folder"}], ",", 
                RowBox[{"\"\<Cases\>\"", "->", "summary"}]}], "|>"}], ",", 
              "\"\<WXF\>\""}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
           RowBox[{"If", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"summaryFile", "===", "$Failed"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
              "Print", "[", 
               "\"\<Summary saving failed. Case data are saved.\>\"", "]"}], 
              ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
              RowBox[{"Return", "[", 
               RowBox[{"<|", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"\"\<Folder\>\"", "->", "folder"}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"\"\<Cases\>\"", "->", "summary"}]}], "|>"}], 
               "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
           RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"row", "[", "\"\<Status\>\"", "]"}], ",", "\"\<: \>\"", 
             ",", "caseName", ",", "\"\< | \>\"", ",", 
             RowBox[{"Round", "[", "seconds", "]"}], ",", "\"\< seconds\>\"", 
             ",", "\"\< | records = \>\"", ",", 
             RowBox[{"row", "[", "\"\<RecordCount\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
           "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
